    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given $n=5, p=\\frac{1}{4}$ and $q=1-p=\\frac{3}{4}$<br><p>Required probability <math><mo>=</mo></math> when no machine has fault <math><mo>+</mo></math> when one machine has fault <math><mo>+</mo></math> when two machines have fault.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow></mrow><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow></mrow><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow></mrow><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>243</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1024</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>405</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1024</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>270</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1024</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>918</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1024</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>459</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>512</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>27</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>17</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>64</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>17</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>17</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"
